Shruti
Copyright 2026 Udgam Labs

The Shruti model (https://huggingface.co/udgamlabs/Shruti; the weights are not stored in this repository) is a
modified version of Cactus Whistle (https://huggingface.co/Cactus-Compute/whistle), copyright Cactus Compute, licensed
under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Changes made by Udgam Labs: added 714 Devanagari vocabulary pieces and a Hindi language tag; retrained all model
weights on Hindi, English and Hinglish speech (2,732 hours) with quantisation-aware training; exported as shruti.cact.

This repository includes, in examples/browser/needle/, the WebAssembly build of the Cactus needle engine (needle.js,
needle.wasm) by Cactus Compute, Inc., copied unmodified from https://huggingface.co/Cactus-Compute/needle3 (revision
3391a1007e7db31d2fe5c69c734bbe93a9c1ce79), Apache-2.0; see the LICENSE.txt and NOTICE.txt in that folder.
The other examples download the Cactus engine (command-line binary or the cactus-compute Python package) from Cactus
Compute at run time; it is not included here.

